@AuthService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5232

### Prijava (zahteva da UserService radi na portu 5231)
POST {{AuthService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Osvezavanje tokena
POST {{AuthService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE"
}

### Odjava
POST {{AuthService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE"
}

### Ponisti sve sesije korisnika (interni poziv iz UserService-a)
POST {{AuthService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/revoke/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Sve sesije korisnika (Admin)
GET {{AuthService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/sessions/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Accept: application/json
